@aniesbaswedan tau keadaan Indonesia saat ini.. pak Anies keren malam ini

i purchased Samsung Refreigerator with model detail:   Samsung 653 L, 3 Star, Frost Free, Double Door, Convertible 5-in-1 Digital Inverter, Side By Side AI Enabled Smart Refrigerator with WiFi (RS76CG8003S9HL, Silver, Refined Inox)  on 17th May it got delivered and the engineer came in the evening, did a quick check on front and back and asked us not to turn on for at least 5-6 hours for the gas to settle down. we did not turn it on for next 24 hours.  when we started filling all the food items inside the fridge, a noise was observed while opening and closing the door. we called the reliance store sale person from where we purchased it, he guided us to the call center to raise request. we raised request in both samsung and Reliance store with following details mentioned  
4th June 2026 - Service ID: 547827 order ID:8081662724  
19 May 2025: Service ID: 5343775 order id: 8081255490
@SamsungIndia  Kept cancelling all the request despite multiple follow ups and i kept getting cancellation requests for 4435951701 and they refused to register complaint at the first place on 19th when i called and asked to connect with store
Since then we were following up for the visit and no one came to visit from both Reliance and samsung.  on 4th we came to know that the request has been cancelled and re-raised the request. Next day engineer visit and when he inspected, he found the fridge the damaged at the bottom near stand (they called it bush).  We visited the store and spoken to Engineer Rahul, Samsung ASM Himanshu(who is very arrogant, rude and unprofessional) , he said i am in a meeting and when i called him multiple times he never answered.   I went to the relience store and raised the concern.   I have all the video of proof, screenshots, even the camerage recording where the visiting engineer said this is a defective peice and should be replaced but samsung will never take the accoutability.  I have purchased extented warrenty for this and still left with defective peice with No support from Samsung and Reliance Store.  I request to please provide me early resolution since all the other product which i purchased for my household has always been from Reliance and that too from that particular store. This is a very pathetic experience and want early resolution to this matter

@SamsungIndia 
@RelianceDigital 
@SamsungSuport

